@* Every page but the landing page renders inside the docs shell (Layout/DocsLayout.razor); the landing
   page and the not-found page opt out with @layout MainLayout. After a navigation the page's own H1
   takes focus, so a screen reader starts reading at the new page. *@
<Router AppAssembly="typeof(Routes).Assembly" NotFoundPage="typeof(Pages.NotFound)">
    <Found Context="routeData">
        <RouteView RouteData="routeData" DefaultLayout="typeof(Layout.DocsLayout)" />
        <FocusOnNavigate RouteData="routeData" Selector="h1" />
    </Found>
</Router>

@* Connects the browser script (started early by <BelemetryScript /> in App.razor's head) to .NET once
   the app is interactive: consent and the session flow both ways, and the WebAssembly pipeline gets
   its unload flush. Placed once, here, so every page has it; it renders nothing. *@
<BelemetryInitializer />

@* The site's consent banner, on every page (see Shared/ConsentBanner.razor). The demo is opt-in
   (Consent.Default = None), so nothing leaves the browser until it is answered. *@
<ConsentBanner />
